WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.140
One canceled show, four nights locked in.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.560
Tour Rescue helps you find a way forward.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:12.120
On your phone, compare a replacement, a detour, or a day off.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.900
Keep confirmed shows intact.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.020
Qloo adds cultural fit evidence beyond the shortest drive.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.540
On a tablet, test the trade off.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.800
In this synthetic example, raise the extra distance limit

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.300
from 350 to 354.1 kilometers.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:35.480
Nuremberg becomes Frankfurt.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.690
On desktop, inspect the evidence.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:49.010
Control artist and comparison artist checks.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:58.950
Real Qloo results are labeled separately.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:00.710
Missing data stays unknown.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:03.270
Fit is not a ticket sales forecast.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.980
Export a promoter draft and audit.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.520
Availability, fees, and booking still need confirmation.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:20.970
Need another lead?

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:22.430
Try the research demo.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:25.350
Check its sources, then accept it into comparison.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.450
The checker runs again.

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.470
Tour Rescue, keep the tour moving.

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:36.450
Try the app.
